===Wordstǣr===
Of Engliscum ''[[þū]]''; gelīc Þēodiscum ''[[du]]''.

===Selfes Bīnama===
2er mann ānfealdlic, nemniendlic cāsus (''manigfealdlic'': [[ye]] oþþe [[you]])<br>
(''forgifendlic'': [[thee]]; ''wrēgendlic'': [[thee]]; ''edhwierfendlic'': [[thyself]], ''āgniendlic'': [[thy]]; ''āgniendlic bínama'': [[thine]])
#[''[[Ealdlic]]'' oþþe ''[[bōclic]]'']: [[you]] (''unhēalic oþþe gecīegendlic Godes''); se man þe biþ gecīeged.

====Bryce====
''Thou'' brȳcþ man on nīwum Englisce mid þǣm ealdum 2um ānfealdlicum worda, þe endaþ mid ''-st''.
: "Lovest thou me?" (Lufast þu mec?)

